{"id":"n59311-1-5","stage":5,"title":"부축 · 搀扶","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59311-1-5-1","ko":"아, 아무래도 발목이 삔 것 같아.","zh":"啊，看来我的脚踝扭伤了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"아：喂。","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"5","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"아무래도","meaning":"到底，还是","explanation":"아무래도：到底，还是。","readings":[{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71330","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}},{"text":"발목이","meaning":"脚脖子，脚踝","explanation":"발목：脚脖子，脚踝；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"발목","audio":"/audio/8bdf6c1c6e18700e7ba6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56817","senseId":"1","lemma":"발목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발목이","audio":"/audio/6e1016135c8a5dba450d.mp3"}},{"text":"삔","meaning":"扭，崴，闪","explanation":"삐다：扭，崴，闪；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"삐다","audio":"/audio/98b004e562c23186c86c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61531","senseId":"1","lemma":"삐다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삔","audio":"/audio/f16869c5610c7d8a358e.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）","explanation":"것：前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"要和别人搭话或引起注意时先发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"f5dbee1c946c5e6b","term":"아무래도","zh":"到底，还是","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3","entryId":"71330","definition":"不管怎么想；或指不管怎么做。","pronunciation":["아ː무래도"]},{"id":"8bdf6c1c6e18700e","term":"발목","zh":"脚脖子，脚踝","audio":"/audio/8bdf6c1c6e18700e7ba6.mp3","entryId":"56817","definition":"腿和脚连接的部位。","pronunciation":["발목"]},{"id":"98b004e562c23186","term":"삐다","zh":"扭，崴，闪","audio":"/audio/98b004e562c23186c86c.mp3","entryId":"61531","definition":"身体的某一部位受到冲击折伤或拧伤使骨关节错位。","pronunciation":["삐ː다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5593ebee3964c010cfef.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59311-1-5-2","ko":"어머, 괜찮아? 내가 부축 좀 해 줄게.","zh":"哎呀，你没事吧？让我来扶着你吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦。","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮아?","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아","audio":"/audio/87dea6f32ecb5a9bbac8.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"부축","meaning":"搀扶，扶持","explanation":"부축：搀扶，扶持。","readings":[{"term":"부축","audio":"/audio/530e149ab2533adc278d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59311","senseId":"1","lemma":"부축","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부축","audio":"/audio/530e149ab2533adc278d.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"줄게.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄게","audio":"/audio/f81c77e211e7de437a74.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9a1c609712d2db0e","term":"어머","zh":"哎哟，哦","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3","entryId":"30195","definition":"主要是女性因没料到的事情感到惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어머"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前